# Local AI-assistant context for DeepSeek Harness (not source)
.dsh/

# DeepSeek Harness tooling. These are plain Node packages that happened to live
# in this tree; they are not part of the mod and must not ship with it. They now
# live under the harness folder, and these rules keep any stray copy out of the
# repository.
#
# Historical note: an earlier revision did the OPPOSITE — it re-included
# dsh-snapshot wholesale (`!dsh-snapshot/**`) to rescue lib/index.js from the
# `lib/` rule above. That committed the assistant's plugin source into the mod's
# history, which is why the ignore rules are explicit here now.
dsh-snapshot/
dsh-balance-guard/
dsh-*/
.shione-memory.md
